# Build context of the API image is the repository root (apps/api/Dockerfile).
# It needs integrations/, apps/api/ and VERSION; everything else stays out.
**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/dist
**/*.egg-info
# setuptools output of local builds: stale files there would end up in the image's packages.
**/build
**/*.shcbak
**/.env
**/secrets
apps/android
apps/web
infra
services
docs
.git
.github
